- Supporting local booking platforms;
- Requiring benefit-sharing agreements for concessions;
- Encouraging joint ventures with local ownership;
- Providing small businesses with access to international distribution;
- Publishing local supplier directories;
- Negotiating fair concession terms for protected areas and heritage sites.

